  "description": "This library provides common functional types and operations on them:\n      *  Option<T> - wraps a value that might not exist in a safe manner;\n      *  Result<T, E> - wraps a value that might not exist due to some processing error;\n      *  OneOf<T1, T2, T3> - discriminated union on one of T1, T2 or T3.\n      See more at https://github.com/JFomit/JFomit.Functional.",
